        <h3 style="color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;">&#128218; Academic Excellence</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">Our university has been a center of academic excellence for over a century. The traditions of rigorous scholarship, innovative research, and intellectual curiosity continue to define our community today.</p>

        <h3 style="color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;">&#127912; Art & Architecture</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">The campus houses an impressive collection of public art, including sculptures, murals, and installations by renowned artists. Our buildings showcase architectural styles ranging from Gothic Revival to modern contemporary.</p>

        <h3 style="color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;">&#127925; Music & Performing Arts</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">From our world-class concert hall to intimate recital spaces, music has always been central to campus life. Our performing arts programs produce dozens of concerts, plays, and dance performances each year.</p>

        <h3 style="color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;">&#127941; Sports Traditions</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">Athletics play a vital role in campus culture. Our teams have won numerous championships, and the spirit of friendly competition brings the community together throughout the year.</p>
